  "description": "AvocadoSmoothie.Barista provides fast, parallel median smoothing and streamlined CSV / Excel export for large numeric sequences. It computes two median-based smoothers (Middle Median with border preservation, and All Median), reports progress, honors cancellation, and exports results with headers and charting (Excel).\n\nAdded radius-based overload ComputeMediansByRadius(R) and clarified that ComputeMedians.kernelRadius is window width W (odd); CsvBrewService/ExcelBrewService now convert R → W, with XML / API / README updated accordingly.",
